{
  "bodyHash": "404942817c863258",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Tanuki Decor</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組新增了超過 200 種方塊，涵蓋時鐘、座椅和床鋪，以及儲物櫃、燈光和裝飾品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>DIY 手工製作</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">家具使用 DIY 工作檯進行製作。在工作檯中放入鵝卵石、原木、黏土球和鐵錠，並選擇要製作的物品。DIY 配方可以在配置文件中禁用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/diy_workbench_gui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"499\" height=\"280\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>時鐘</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這裡有 30 多種擁有迷人紋理和獨特音效的時鐘。許多時鐘會在中午、午夜或黎明報時。最重要的是，這些時鐘顯示的時間非常準確！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/grandfather_clock.png\" width=\"61\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_clock_tower_dial.png\" width=\"93\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/owl_clock.png\" width=\"49\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/green_clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"73\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/red_clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"73\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>座椅</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">享受 20 多種座位選擇，從凳子到椅子再到沙發。現在，當你結束了一天艱苦的採礦和製作工作回到家後，可以終於把腳放下來放鬆一下了。有些座位一次可以容納兩名玩家！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/sweets_sofa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cabana_chair.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gorgeous_seat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"88\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/wooden_block_chair.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>寢具</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否厭倦了那些小號且帶有霓虹色調的床？是否厌倦了與村民共用一張床？現在推出 10 多種主題床，包括雙人床和華蓋床。舒適的枕頭總是*包含在內*！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/green_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/antique_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gorgeous_bed.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"160\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/wooden_block_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>儲物</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tanuki Decor 新增了 30 多種儲物方塊，從床頭梳妝台到 2x2 的衣櫥應有盡有。大多數這些方塊都能容納一個雙層箱子數量的物品。選擇最適合你的款式，告別難看的箱子和木桶吧。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/antique_cabinet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"121\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/blue_wardrobe.png\" width=\"88\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/minimalist_dresser.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cabana_vanity.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>燈光</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當你可以擁有檯燈、壁爐，甚至霓虹燈牌時，誰還需要火把呢？用十幾種舒適的照明選項來提升你的居家氛圍。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/minimalist_lamp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_fireplace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/egyptian_lamp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/regal_wall_lamp.png\" width=\"95\" height=\"80\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>家具系列</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過精選自 10 個不同系列的家具展現自我風格。收集全套吧！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">古董系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/antique_series.png\" alt=\"Antique Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">藍色系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/blue_series.png\" alt=\"Blue Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">海灘小屋系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/cabana_series.png\" alt=\"Cabana Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">埃及系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/egyptian_series.png\" alt=\"Egyptian Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">華麗系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/gorgeous_series.png\" alt=\"Gorgeous Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">綠色系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/green_series.png\" alt=\"Green Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">實驗室系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/lab_series.png\" alt=\"Cabana Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">極簡主義系列</span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/minimalist_series.png\" alt=\"Minimalist Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/mushroom_series.png\" alt=\"Cabana Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">皇家系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/regal_series.png\" alt=\"Regal Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">糖果系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/sweets_series.png\" alt=\"Sweets Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">木塊系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/wooden_block_series.png\" alt=\"Wooden Block Series\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>裝飾品</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組中還有額外的 60 多種裝飾方塊，包括各種尺寸的桌子、各式花瓶、彩色綵帶以及其他點綴品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gumball_machine.png\" width=\"55\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/ship_in_a_bottle.png\" width=\"77\" height=\"80\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/blue_table.png\" width=\"136\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/sweets_mini_table.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/stall_tarp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>功能性</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了美觀之外，部分方塊還具有額外功能！詳情請見下文。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鳥籠</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有鸚鵡嗎？想把它鎖在籠子裡嗎？鳥籠正是為此而生！當你的鸚鵡站在肩膀上時，對鳥籠使用右鍵點擊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/birdcage.png\" alt=\"鳥籠\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/elegant_birdcage.png\" alt=\"典雅鳥籠\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">收銀機</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以播放令人滿意的「叮」聲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cash_register.png\" alt=\"收銀機\" width=\"121\" height=\"133\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">展示櫃</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用一個或兩個高品質的展示櫃來炫耀你的寶藏。它也支持顯示自定義名稱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/display_case.png\" alt=\"展示櫃\" width=\"156\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/long_display_case.png\" alt=\"長展示櫃\" width=\"176\" height=\"206\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地球儀</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活後會隨機旋轉。地球儀在停止旋轉後，會根據其朝向提供比較器輸出。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/globe.png\" alt=\"地球儀\" width=\"104\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手推車</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">儲存你的一堆物品的實用且具裝飾性的方式</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/handcart.png\" alt=\"手推車\" width=\"106\" height=\"87\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙漏</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以啟動 30 秒計時器，比較器輸出每 2 秒變化一次。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/hourglass.png\" alt=\"沙漏\" width=\"113\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷你人偶</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以播放吱吱作響的絨毛玩具聲音。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/mayoral_mini_figure.png\" alt=\"市長迷你人偶\" width=\"123\" height=\"126\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">節拍器</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以改變其滴答聲的速度並關閉它。共有 7 種速度設定。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/metronome.png\" alt=\"節拍器\" width=\"88\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牛頓擺</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以開啟和關閉。在其下方放置羊毛塊以靜音。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/newtons_cradle.png\" alt=\"牛頓擺\" width=\"119\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留聲機</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這就是唱盤機 2.0！坐下觀看唱片旋轉，同時聆聽你最愛的黑膠唱片。對於非模組化的唱片磁碟，它支持與 1.20+ 版本唱盤機相同的漏斗功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/phonograph.png\" alt=\"留聲機\" width=\"129\" height=\"179\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鋼琴</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以播放隨機音符。如果鋼琴下方有一個音符盒，它將播放該音符盒的聲音。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/piano.png\" alt=\"鋼琴\" width=\"168\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">等離子球</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以開啟和關閉。喔，好扭動啊！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/plasma_ball.gif\" alt=\"等離子球\" width=\"195\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火箭燈</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">好吧，這個沒有特殊用途。我只是想展示一下動畫效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/rocket_lamp.gif\" alt=\"火箭燈\" width=\"195\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">科學艙</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通過在這些充滿泡泡、科幻風格的艙體內展示特殊物品，釋放你內心的瘋狂科學家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/science_pod.png\" alt=\"科學艙\" width=\"90\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">老虎機</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你覺得自己幸運嗎，小夥子？轉一下吧。老虎機在使用期間會輸出比較器信號 1，當贏得頭獎時輸出 15。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/slot_machine.png\" alt=\"老虎機\" width=\"90\" height=\"192\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火車模型</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">享受觀看模型火車在永無止境的迴圈中行駛。你可以在軌道下方放置羊毛塊以靜音音效。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/train_set.png\" alt=\"火車模型\" width=\"192\" height=\"94\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">花瓶</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些瓷罐只能容納單個堆疊的物品，但至少看起來很漂亮！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/classic_vase.png\" alt=\"經典花瓶\" width=\"76\" height=\"120\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"華麗花瓶\" width=\"76\" height=\"120\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"大型華麗花瓶\" width=\"101\" height=\"160\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_striped_vase.png\" alt=\"大型條紋花瓶\" width=\"120\" height=\"140\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/small_fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"小型華麗花瓶\" width=\"53\" height=\"56\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/small_striped_vase.png\" alt=\"小型條紋花瓶\" width=\"69\" height=\"56\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可以通過將單個物品和配方添加到 \"tanukidecor:diy_blacklist\" 物品標籤中來禁用它們。<br>有關更多選項，請參見配置文件 \"tanukidecor-common.cfg\"。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>致謝</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/skyjay1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">skyjay1</a> - 代碼和維護<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tobcs123/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thatonebrasschronoshinx</a> - 創意、項目管理和音效設計<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/skart/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skart2000</a> - 模型和藝術創作<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crabmods/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CrabMods</a> - 移植至 NeoForge 1.21.1</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：Forge 還是 Fabric？<br><strong>答</strong>：僅支持 Forge / NeoForge。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：我可以在整合包中使用這個模組嗎？<br><strong>答</strong>：可以。請鏈接至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tanukidecor\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 頁面</a>，而不是重新分發該模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：你有 Discord 伺服器嗎？<br><strong>答</strong>：你可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.tophatcat.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">MMD 伺服器</a> 的 <span style=\"color:#36f\">#skyjay-mods</span> 頻道（位於「社區模組」下）找到我</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：我有個建議！<br><strong>答</strong>：太好了！請在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tanukidecor\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 頁面</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/skyjay1/Tanuki-Decor/issues/2\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上的建議問題區留言。</span></p>",
